x="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="760" width="160" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_db" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Adaptateur PostgreSQL&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#374151&quot;&gt;Kysely, migrations au démarrage&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="760" width="440" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_st" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Adaptateur&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#374151&quot;&gt;Redis&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="760" width="140" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a_tu" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Adaptateur coturn&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot; color=&quot;#374151&quot;&gt;identifiants REST (HMAC)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="760" width="220" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x_id" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Microsoft Entra ID&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="580" y="900" width="160" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x_db" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Cloud SQL pour PostgreSQL 16&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="900" width="440" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x_st" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;Redis 7&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="900" width="140" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="x_tu" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;coturn&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3F4F6;strokeColor=#6b7280;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1420" y="900" width="220" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=nowrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#d1d5db;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="250" width="490" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes_h" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Principes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="258" width="460" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="notes_b" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Un seul déploiement : l'API actuelle, découpée en modules&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   par domaine. Pas de microservices.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Chaque module expose une interface publique (ses ports)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   et cache son intérieur.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Un module n'accède ni aux tables ni au code interne&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   d'un autre : il passe par ses ports.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Hexagonale ensuite : le domaine ne dépend ni de Fastify,&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   ni de PostgreSQL, ni de Redis, ni de Socket.IO.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Les adaptateurs se branchent sur les ports : la base et&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   l'authentification deviennent interchangeables.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• La scalabilité est une fonctionnalité avancée : pas de&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;   répartition de charge applicative pour l'instant.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot; color=&quot;#1f2937&quot;&gt;• Impact infra : aucun, un seul conteneur API.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="290" width="460" height="216" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1f2937;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="client" target="entr"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d0" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1f2937;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.1182;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entr" target="auth"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1f2937;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.3727;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entr" target="users"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d2" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1f2937;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.6273;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entr" target="msg"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="d3" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1f2937;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.8818;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="entr" target="calls"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m1" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1a73e8;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.3286;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3286;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="auth" target="users"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m2" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#1a73e8;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0;exitY=0.3286;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3286;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="msg" target="users"><mxGeometry re